From: Ben Chatelain <ben@octop.ad>
Date: Sat, 18 Oct 2025 19:36:45 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] feat(zsh): add shebang to all function files

Add #!/usr/bin/env zsh shebang to all 171 function files for:
- Proper interpreter specification
- Ability to execute functions as standalone scripts
- Better editor recognition and syntax highlighting
- Shell script best practices compliance

Each file now starts with shebang followed by two blank lines
before the function definition.
---
 .config/zsh/functions/ignore | 3 +++
 .config/zsh/functions/list   | 3 +++
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/.config/zsh/functions/ignore b/.config/zsh/functions/ignore
index aa0c..8e0c 100644
--- a/.config/zsh/functions/ignore
+++ b/.config/zsh/functions/ignore
@@ -1,3 +1,6 @@
+#!/usr/bin/env zsh
+
+
 function ignore() {
     local gitignore="$(root)/.gitignore"
     local ignore_list
